  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Stonex Financial obligated $240M in FY27 to date. Stonex Financial received 28 awards so far in the current fiscal year, with an average award size of $8.6M. Stonex Financial obligations are down 81.4% year over year. Stonex Financial recorded previous annual obligation totals of $1.7B in FY22, $1.7B in FY23, $703M in FY24, $1.3B in FY25, and $1.3B in FY26. Stonex Financial current-year totals are partial because the period is FY2027 to date and the reported figures are contract obligations except for award-value tables. Stonex Financial award-count and average-award-size figures reflect awards counted in the current fiscal year. Stonex Financial historical obligations show significant variation from FY22 through FY27 to date, with the FY27 to-date total smaller than every prior full fiscal year in the record provided.",
